.TH tkutltools n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkutltools
.PP
Umbrella for the tablelist extension family. Requiring this one package pulls in \fBtablelist\fR (external) plus all \fBtkutl*\fR helpers and their shared \fBtclutils::tunum\fR number backend.
.SS Package
.CS
package require tkutils::tkutltools 0.1
.CE
.PP
It is kept \fBseparate\fR from the main \fBtkutils\fR umbrella, which by design loads only modules with pure\-Tk/tclutils dependencies. \fBtablelist\fR is external, so require \fBtkutltools\fR only where tablelist is available.
.SS Loads
.TS
l l.
Module	Purpose
\fBtkutils::tkutlsort\fR	type\-aware column sorting (num/currency via tunum)
\fBtkutils::tkutlfmt\fR	per\-column display formatting
\fBtkutils::tkutlclip\fR	copy rows to clipboard (TSV/CSV)
\fBtkutils::tkutlfooter\fR	synced footer + autosum/autoagg
\fBtkutils::tkutlfind\fR	incremental find + highlight
\fBtkutils::tkutlstate\fR	save/restore column layout
\fBtkutils::tkutltree\fR	nested data ↔ multi\-column tree
\fBtclutils::tunum\fR	shared number parse/sum backend
.TE
.SS Usage
.CS
package require Tk
package require tkutils::tkutltools

# all tkutl* commands are now available
tablelist::tablelist .t -columns {0 Article left 0 Price right}
::tkutils::tkutlsort::column .t 1 num
::tkutils::tkutlfmt::column  .t 1 currency
::tkutils::tkutlclip::installBindings .t
.CE
.PP
See the individual module docs for details.
